{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19820","headline":"寒江吟 · 孟郊","name":"寒江吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬至日光白，始知阴气凝。\n寒江波浪冻，千里无平冰。\n飞鸟绝高羽，行人皆晏兴。\n荻洲素浩渺，碕岸澌碐磳。\n烟舟忽自阻，风帆不相乘。\n何况异形体，信任爲股肱。\n涉江莫涉凌，得意须得朋。\n结交非贤良，谁免生爱憎。\n冻水有再浪，失飞有载腾。\n一言纵丑词，万响无善应。\n取鉴谅不远，江水千万层。\n何当春风吹，利涉吾道弘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}